Using the function below, what is the value of `c` after `c = 0; for (i = 1; i <= 10; i++) c += isprime(i);` runs?
```
int isprime(int n) {
    int d;
    if (n < 2) return 0;
    for (d = 2; d < n; d++)
        if (n % d == 0) return 0;
    return 1;
}
```
